# Curious Farm Animals: "Destroy UP TO ONE target artifact or enchantment" lets the ability be activated with no target at
# all, though a Mox Sapphire is there to be chosen. The sacrifice is paid anyway and is a death: the Sapphire stays, Bot1
# gains 3 life (23) and has the creature in its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Curious Farm Animals
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
