Bot1.Hand.Curious Farm Animals.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Curious Farm Animals.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

